            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/7e51b29c28551ab631fb9f25b9a719e5.avif?t=1792600204\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras_big/7e51b29c28551ab631fb9f25b9a719e5.webp?t=1792600204 width=1560 height=1082 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escolha entre <strong>várias raças e classes que mudam de forma significativa como seu herói luta, sobrevive e evolui</strong>, e então encare um roguelike tradicional criado em torno de combate tático por turnos, masmorras procedurais, desbloqueios permanentes e várias formas de jogar. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Empire combina a tensão clássica da exploração de masmorras com uma interface mais moderna, diferentes modos de jogo e alto valor de replay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/bc35775a2a4ecc63c70a87de822a6765.poster.avif?t=1792600204\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/bc35775a2a4ecc63c70a87de822a6765.webm?t=1792600204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/bc35775a2a4ecc63c70a87de822a6765.mp4?t=1792600204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/555fcdcf222c6191f9c8c333f8fb4883.avif?t=1792600204\" width=1280 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Todo herói começa com uma classe — nenhum termina igual</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construa seu herói a partir de escolhas de raça, classe e dificuldade, depois evolua por meio de identidade de classe, decisões do jogador, ofertas emergentes de talentos, magias, espólios e recompensas raras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“<i>Algumas builds se tornam lendas. Outras se tornam lições.</i>”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/2042e2b123943cb24cae10311d506143.avif?t=1792600204\" width=600 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/fa154d8b168699a95b3f5f7c5de9138c.avif?t=1792600204\" width=600 height=333 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/555fcdcf222c6191f9c8c333f8fb4883.avif?t=1792600204\" width=1280 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore, cumpra missões e desafie seus limites</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escolha como quer jogar. Siga a campanha principal, vá atrás de missões opcionais, explore o mapa do mundo, descubra pontos de interesse ou avance em modos especiais onde os riscos aumentam quanto mais fundo você desce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“<i>Mais um andar sempre parece uma ideia razoável. Até deixar de ser.</i>”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/a3e33623081183c3be2f866f4e2ef0bb.poster.avif?t=1792600204\" width=798 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/a3e33623081183c3be2f866f4e2ef0bb.webm?t=1792600204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/a3e33623081183c3be2f866f4e2ef0bb.mp4?t=1792600204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/7e071f9a04b2bc28b5b3bc45dddbb1c6.poster.avif?t=1792600204\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/7e071f9a04b2bc28b5b3bc45dddbb1c6.webm?t=1792600204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/7e071f9a04b2bc28b5b3bc45dddbb1c6.mp4?t=1792600204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/d1b7e0363987ca04dd5697ec7f8b1d98.avif?t=1792600204\" width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/555fcdcf222c6191f9c8c333f8fb4883.avif?t=1792600204\" width=1280 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cada turno abre novas oportunidades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enfrente batalhas em grade, por turnos, contra inimigos perigosos, variantes campeãs e chefes únicos, usando posicionamento, talentos, magia, itens, armadilhas e gerenciamento de recursos para virar cada encontro a seu favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desvende segredos esquecidos, reivindique itens lendários e complete conjuntos de equipamento poderosos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“<i>Aplica-se uma política rígida de não reembolso. Principalmente à sua vida.</i>”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/1d8c5518f57b50c97c6edfd65721e69d.poster.avif?t=1792600204\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/1d8c5518f57b50c97c6edfd65721e69d.webm?t=1792600204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/1d8c5518f57b50c97c6edfd65721e69d.mp4?t=1792600204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/555fcdcf222c6191f9c8c333f8fb4883.avif?t=1792600204\" width=1280 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A morte não é o fim</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desbloqueie novas vantagens, descubra caminhos de história ilustrados, alcance finais diferentes e suba nos placares de líderes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > “Seu herói pode cair, mas pelo menos serviu como uma moeda bem útil.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650940/extras/8293a00f7ba65358953f7536e33d7db8.avif?t=1792600204\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
